ull/106147 should be merged first, so I have marked this as draft.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes the `print_verbose` macro to `PRINT_VERBOSE`, for 3 reasons:\r\n\r\n1. Fixes a name conflict with GDExtension `UtilityFunctions`: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/pull/1668\r\n2. Fixes a name conflict with the engine's internal `VariantUtilityFunctions`, avoiding this awkwardness:\r\n<img width=\"387\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-12-09 at 2 35 36 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d5adc13-ad4d-4ebd-83c8-b768a20a6064\">\r\n\r\n3. Capitalizing the macro is consistent with the style used for all other macros in Godot.\r\n\r\nThis PR may minorly affect compatibility with third-party modules, but does not change the exposed scripting API. However, it is trivial for third-party modules to either update their code or add `print_verbose` as an alias.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","fol